Hello %USER%,

On <b>%START%</b> at <b>%TIME%</b> the Romans, Gauls and Teutons began their struggle for this game world. Right now <b>%PLAYERS%</b> players in <b>%ALLI%</b> alliances are fighting for supremacy. You are under beginner's protection for a short while, but to find your way in this dangerous world it is best to look for an alliance soon.

Your advisor will help you on your way with tasks, tips and resources. Complete the tasks he gives you and he will reward you in many ways. Once you have finished his tasks you will be ready to defend yourself in this world of war, rivalry and friendship.

You start the game with a special unit in your village: your hero. The hero is a very strong and valuable soldier, and you can change his looks as you like. With your hero you can lead your armies to victory and conquer oases, and you can send him on dangerous and exciting adventures. On adventures your hero may find treasures - lost soldiers, animals to catch or items that give him special powers. If your hero comes back empty-handed you can buy such items and equipment at the auctions other players start, paying with Travian silver.

Besides the other players you will meet another people in this world: the Natars, an ancient tribe of legendary strength. Take care when you found a new village: if you settle in their grey area they will attack it to defend their land. Only the Natars know the secret of the most magnificent building of this world - the Wonder of the World. They are very strong, so be careful in any conflict with them.

